    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`monoServer` is the pre-production server module for the `startio` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for pre-production server activation, route/service availability, and runtime topology. Business behavior belongs in active application or framework modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Pre-production server settings should support release validation while preserving production-like governance."
    }
